<li>PostgreSQL 18: <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/app-pgcombinebackup.html">pg_combinebackup</a>, <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/app-pgverifybackup.html">pg_verifybackup</a> and <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/runtime-config-wal.html#RUNTIME-CONFIG-WAL-RECOVERY-TARGET">recovery target settings</a>: dependencies, verification limits and exact stopping semantics.</li>
